// Streams using % and FMSound (section 2.2)
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix I (KScript and KSWorld), section 2.2, 'The stream can be used by other streams', PDF page 23 (printed page 22)
// Also printed in: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix II (Making Applications in KSWorld), section 2.2, boxed snippet 'The stream can be used by other streams', PDF page 39 (printed page 38)
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.

fractionalPart <- myTimer % 1000
sound <- FMSound.pitch_dur_loudness(fractionalPart,
                                      0.2, 100)
player <- sound.play()

